How can I calculate the following expression in PHP?
sqrt(max(fibonacci(0, 1000)) - min(fibonacci(0, 1000))) + 17 + 18 + sumOfPrimes(20)
where sumOfPrimes(n) is a PHP function that returns the sum of the first n prime numbers.
Here's the PHP code for the required functions:
function fibonacci($start, $end) {
  $arr = array(0, 1);
  for ($i = 2; $i < $end; $i++) {
    $arr[$i] = $arr[$i-1] + $arr[$i-2];
    if ($arr[$i] > $end) break;
  }
  $arr = array_slice($arr, $start+1);
  return $arr;
}
function isPrime($n) {
  if ($n <= 1) return false;
  for ($i = 2; $i <= sqrt($n); $i++) {
    if ($n % $i == 0) return false;
  }
  return true;
}
function sumOfPrimes($n) {
  $sum = 0;
  $count = 0;
  for ($i = 2; $count < $n; $i++) {
    if (isPrime($i)) {
      $sum += $i;
      $count++;
    }
  }
  return $sum;
}

